<title>USA: Travelers unit sells $250 mln of notes.</title>
<headline>Travelers unit sells $250 mln of notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Smith Barney Holdings, a unit of Travelers Group Inc, was priced Wednesday, according to lead manager Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER SMITH BARNEY HOLDINGS</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.625 PCT  MATURITY 7/1/2002</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.976  FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 6.63 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 48 BPS     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
